 "description": "Calculate an on-chain credit score (0-100) for any wallet. Factors: transaction history, native balance, token diversity, stablecoin holdings, DeFi activity. Returns grade (AAA to C). Scope: wallet-level financial behavior and activity score based on transaction history, balances, token diversity, stablecoins, and DeFi use. Use this for 'how active or creditworthy is this wallet?'. It is not Agent identity/reputation (agent.reputation), a registered card (agent.card.lookup), or token/contract risk.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
